Third-party code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains code derived from the following projects. Their copyright
notices are retained in the files concerned.

DeiT — https://github.com/facebookresearch/deit
    Copyright (c) 2015-present, Facebook, Inc. Licensed under Apache License 2.0.
    `main.py`, `engine.py`, `datasets.py`, `samplers.py` and `utils.py` follow DeiT's
    training scaffolding: argument parsing, the epoch loop, dataset and transform
    construction, the repeated-augmentation sampler, and the distributed/metric helpers.

pytorch-image-models (timm) — https://github.com/huggingface/pytorch-image-models
    Copyright 2019 Ross Wightman. Licensed under Apache License 2.0.
    Used as a dependency. `toast/patch.py` subclasses timm's `VisionTransformer` `Block`
    and `Attention`, and `toast/dense.py` reimplements their forward passes on re-packed
    weights.

DiffRate — https://github.com/OpenGVLab/DiffRate
    This work began as a fork of DiffRate (ICCV 2023). DiffRate's differentiable
    compression-rate search, token merging and pruning are not part of ToaST and have been
    removed from this release; refer to the upstream repository to reproduce DiffRate as a
    baseline. What remains of that lineage is the DeiT-derived scaffolding above.

Token Merging (ToMe) — https://github.com/facebookresearch/ToMe
    DiffRate's token-processing utilities derived from ToMe. None of that code is used
    here; the attribution is recorded because this repository's history passes through it.
